sequenceDiagram
    participant DSPO as DSP Operator<br/>(inferred)
    participant Driver as KFP Driver/Launcher<br/>API Server (inferred)
    participant Envoy as metadata-envoy<br/>gRPC-Web proxy (inferred)
    participant MLMD as metadata_store_server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant DB as MySQL/MariaDB 3306/TCP<br/>or PostgreSQL 5432/TCP

    Note over DSPO,DB: Flow 1 - Server startup and schema initialization
    DSPO->>MLMD: Start container with DB flags<br/>(--mysql_config_* / --postgres_config_*)
    MLMD->>DB: Connect (MySQL/PostgreSQL wire)<br/>DB user/password, optional TLS (MySQL only)
    MLMD->>DB: Create or upgrade MLMD schema<br/>(--enable_database_upgrade, retry on Aborted)
    DB-->>MLMD: Schema ready
    Note over MLMD: No DB configured: silent fallback<br/>to in-memory fake DB (data lost on restart)
    MLMD->>MLMD: Bind 0.0.0.0:8080<br/>InsecureServerCredentials by default

    Note over Driver,DB: Flow 2 - Recording and querying lineage
    Driver->>MLMD: Put*/Get* RPCs (executions, artifacts, contexts, events)<br/>gRPC plaintext (TLS/mTLS if ssl_config), no auth
    MLMD->>DB: SQL over MySQL wire 3306/TCP<br/>Optional TLS, DB user/password
    DB-->>MLMD: Rows
    MLMD-->>Driver: gRPC response

    Envoy->>MLMD: GetLineageGraph / GetLineageSubgraph<br/>gRPC 8080/TCP, plaintext, no auth at MLMD
    MLMD->>DB: Lineage queries
    DB-->>MLMD: Rows
    MLMD-->>Envoy: Lineage graph
